// SREC - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

// SREC is Motorola's name for an S-record, and the record is the
// encoding of "Hello World!" itself.
//
//   S1 LL <address:2> <data> <checksum>
//
// count 0x0F = 2 address bytes + 12 data bytes + 1 checksum, and
// the checksum is the ones complement of the byte sum.
S10F000048656C6C6F20576F726C6421B3
